msgid "GCS failsafe enable (:ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` )"
msgstr "GCS 失控保护启用（:ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:459
#: bb99166fa8df4a818cea147481f33d96
msgid ""
"Enable ground control station telemetry failsafe. Failsafe will trigger "
"after :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` seconds of no MAVLink "
"heartbeat or RC Override messages."
msgstr ""
"启用地面站数传失控保护。在 :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` 秒内未收到 MAVLink 心跳或 RC "
"Override 消息后触发失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:462
#: ca673d9a322f42158b7025fe27aa5a74
msgid ""
"Enabling this option opens up the possibility of your plane going into "
"failsafe mode and running the motor on the ground if it loses contact with "
"your ground station. While the code attempts to verify that the plane is "
"indeed flying and not on the ground before entering this failsafe, it is "
"safer if this option is enabled on an electric plane, to either use a "
"separate motor arming switch or remove the propeller in any ground testing, "
"if possible."
msgstr ""
"启用此选项后，如果飞机与地面站失去联系，可能会在地面进入失控保护模式并运行电机。虽然代码会尝试验证飞机确实在飞行而非在地面，以便进入此失控保护，但对于电动飞机，启用此选项时更安全的做法是使用单独的电机解锁开关，或在地面测试时（如可能）卸下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:464
#: f5d6d8d2aee343128be7fb69bb8af433
msgid ""
"There are three possible enabled settings. Seeing "
":ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` to 1 means that GCS failsafe will be "
"triggered when the aircraft has not received a MAVLink HEARTBEAT message. "
"Setting :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` to 2 means that GCS failsafe will "
"be triggered on either a loss of HEARTBEAT messages, or a RADIO_STATUS "
"message from a MAVLink enabled telemetry radio indicating that the ground "
"station is not receiving status updates from the aircraft, which is "
"indicated by the RADIO_STATUS.remrssi field being zero (this may happen if "
"you have a one way link due to asymmetric noise on the ground station and "
"aircraft radios).Setting :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` to 3 means that "
"GCS failsafe will be triggered by Heartbeat(like option one), but only in "
"AUTO mode. WARNING: Enabling this option opens up the possibility of your "
"plane going into failsafe mode and running the motor on the ground it it "
"loses contact with your ground station. If this option is enabled on an "
"electric plane then you should enable :ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>`."
msgstr ""
"启用设置有三种可选。:ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` 设为 1 表示当飞机收不到 MAVLink HEARTBEAT "
"消息时触发地面站失控保护。:ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` 设为 2 表示 HEARTBEAT 消息丢失或 "
"MAVLink 数传电台的 RADIO_STATUS 消息表明地面站收不到飞机的状态更新（RADIO_STATUS.remrssi "
"字段为零，单向链路时可能发生，如地面站与飞机电台两端噪声不对称）都会触发。:ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` 设为 3 "
"表示由 Heartbeat 触发（同选项一），但仅在 AUTO "
"模式下。警告：启用此选项后，飞机若在地面上与地面站失联，有可能进入失控保护并使电机转动。电动飞机启用此选项时应同时启用 "
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>`。"

